    **not** "which lines inside it came from upstream", and it certainly does
    **not** mean "this file is granted under MIT". **A file-level provenance
    classification cannot answer a line-level attribution question** -- for
    that, read the line history (`git diff base-snapshot/v2.46.0..HEAD --
